# SmartConfig file graph (M3), built into sc.
# Lines:
#   check NAME GLOB...    these files are read by checker NAME
#   apply NAME TEXT       when a saved change of NAME's files takes effect
#   mode  GLOB OCTAL      mode of a file sc edit creates (default 0644)
# check and mode: the FIRST matching line wins. Globs are the scope's.
# A checker's lines are added with the step that builds it.
